---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";

title: "React 电商工具"
description: "使用React、Node.js和MongoDB开发的全栈电商系统"
technologies: "React, Node.js, MongoDB"
category: "other"
order: 28
---

<Layout title="React 电商工具" description="使用React、Node.js和MongoDB开发的全栈电商系统">
  <section class="bg-div-theme min-h-screen py-12">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-7xl">
      <!-- Tool Header -->
      <div class="mb-12 text-center">
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-div-theme mb-4">React 电商工具</h1>
        <p class="text-theme-secondary max-w-3xl mx-auto">
          使用React、Node.js和MongoDB开发的全栈电商系统。包含认证、购物车、搜索、分类、评论等功能。
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Tool Content -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <!-- Tool Info -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-2">
          <div class="bg-div-theme rounded-xl p-6 shadow-lg border border-div-theme">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-div-theme mb-4">工具介绍</h2>
            <div class="space-y-4 text-theme-secondary">
              <p>
                这是一个功能完整的电商系统，提供了从用户认证到商品购买的全流程解决方案。
                系统采用现代化的技术栈，确保了良好的用户体验和性能。
              </p>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-blue-400 mt-6 mb-2">主要功能</h3>
              <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
                <li>用户注册与登录</li>
                <li>商品浏览与搜索</li>
                <li>购物车管理</li>
                <li>订单处理</li>
                <li>商品分类与筛选</li>
                <li>用户评论系统</li>
                <li>管理员后台</li>
              </ul>
              
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-blue-400 mt-6 mb-2">技术栈</h3>
              <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                <span class="bg-blue-900/30 text-blue-300 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm">React</span>
                <span class="bg-blue-900/30 text-blue-300 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm">Node.js</span>
                <span class="bg-blue-900/30 text-blue-300 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm">Express</span>
                <span class="bg-blue-900/30 text-blue-300 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm">MongoDB</span>
                <span class="bg-blue-900/30 text-blue-300 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm">Tailwind CSS</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Demo Section -->
          <div class="mt-8 bg-div-theme rounded-xl p-6 shadow-lg border border-div-theme">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-div-theme mb-4">在线演示</h2>
            <div class="aspect-video bg-theme-secondary rounded-lg overflow-hidden border border-div-theme">
              <iframe 
                src="https://react-e-commerce-three-phi.vercel.app" 
                class="w-full h-full" 
                frameborder="0" 
                allowfullscreen
                title="React 电商演示"
              ></iframe>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Tool Sidebar -->
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <!-- Quick Links -->
          <div class="bg-div-theme rounded-xl p-6 shadow-lg border border-div-theme">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-div-theme mb-4">快速链接</h3>
            <div class="space-y-3">
              <a 
                href="https://react-e-commerce-three-phi.vercel.app" 
                target="_blank" 
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="flex items-center justify-between p-3 btn-theme rounded-lg transition-colors"
              >
                <span>访问演示</span>
                <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14"></path>
                </svg>
              </a>
              <a 
                href="https://github.com/Lautaro-R-collins/React-E-commerce.git" 
                target="_blank" 
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="flex items-center justify-between p-3 btn-theme rounded-lg transition-colors"
              >
                <span>查看代码</span>
                <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path d="M12 0c-6.626 0-12 5.373-12 12 0 5.302 3.438 9.8 8.207 11.387.599.111.793-.261.793-.577v-2.234c-3.338.726-4.033-1.416-4.033-1.416-.546-1.387-1.333-1.756-1.333-1.756-1.089-.745.083-.729.083-.729 1.205.084 1.839 1.237 1.839 1.237 1.07 1.834 2.807 1.304 3.492.997.107-.775.418-1.305.762-1.604-2.665-.305-5.467-1.334-5.467-5.931 0-1.311.469-2.381 1.236-3.221-.124-.303-.535-1.524.117-3.176 0 0 1.008-.322 3.301 1.23.957-.266 1.983-.399 3.003-.404 1.02.005 2.047.138 3.006.404 2.291-1.552 3.297-1.23 3.297-1.23.653 1.653.242 2.874.118 3.176.77.84 1.235 1.911 1.235 3.221 0 4.609-2.807 5.624-5.479 5.921.43.372.823 1.102.823 2.222v3.293c0 .319.192.694.801.576 4.765-1.589 8.199-6.086 8.199-11.386 0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12z"></path>
                </svg>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Categories -->
          <div class="bg-div-theme rounded-xl p-6 shadow-lg border border-div-theme">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-div-theme mb-4">分类</h3>
            <div class="space-y-2">
              <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-blue-900/30 text-blue-300 rounded-full text-sm">全栈</span>
              <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-blue-900/30 text-blue-300 rounded-full text-sm">React</span>
              <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-blue-900/30 text-blue-300 rounded-full text-sm">电商</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>